invariant: INV-76
file: tools/bench_scoreboard.py
catches: test/lint-bench-numbers.sh
reason: machine_line names one ch_cfg.cpu value for every AEAD row where
  the AES-GCM rows and the ChaCha20-Poly1305 rows ran under two. On the
  AVX-512 machine it then said 0x31f for the ChaCha20-Poly1305 rows,
  which bench/record.sh runs under 0x11f. The committed bullets name both
  values, and lint-bench-numbers compares each bullet with the line.

